BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Sorcerer w/ Special Guest | Re:Made
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261113T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261113T213000
UID:62f86db6cda0b26df33be647aadd3edd@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Four men on the run from the law in South America jump at the 
 chance to solve their problems by accepting a job that pays $10\,000 and w
 ill grant them legal citizenship. The catch? They have to stay alive while
  ferrying a shipment of highly unstable nitroglycerin across 200 miles of 
 bad roads\, unstable bridges\, and unpredictable attacks from local gangs.
  [121 min\; thriller\, suspense\; English and Spanish with English subtitl
 es]\nThe screening will be followed by a discussion of stunt work in film 
 between Leraldo Anzaldua and Patrick Kelly.\nLeraldo Anzaldua is an actor
 \, fight director\, and motion capture performer for film and video games.
  He’s assistant professor of movement and stage combat in IU’s Departm
 ent of Theatre and Drama and certified by the Society of American Fight Di
 rectors. Patrick Kelly is a professional martial artist\, fight choreograp
 her\, stunt coordinator\, and stunt performer. He is the director of Marti
 al Arts at IU and has served as stunt coordinator for feature films and as
  a stunt performer for television shows on the History Channel\, Netflix\,
  and Amazon.
GEO:39.168585;-86.517361
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. 7th Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47405
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/sorcerer-w-special-guest-remade
 /60000/
