BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Beauty and The Beast (1978) | Underground Film Series
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261114T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261114T203000
UID:2c7048c554e4bdf485d42f93a4a80e0e@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:The most uncanny and fierce adaptation of Beauty and the Beast
 \, the film follows the innocent Julie and her experiences living under th
 e watchful eye of Netvor\, a bird-like being torn between his growing affe
 ction for her and his animalistic urge to kill. Directed by Juraj Herz of 
 the Czech New Wave\, Herz masterfully infuses the 18th-century French fair
 ytale of impossible affection with the aesthetics of gothic horror. Restor
 ed by Národní filmový archiv\, Prague and Severin Films\, supported by 
 The Czech Audiovisual Fund. [91 min\; horror\, fantasy\; Czech with Englis
 h subtitles]
GEO:39.168585;-86.517361
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. 7th Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47405
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/beauty-and-the-beast-1978-under
 ground-film-series/60001/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
