DESCRIPTION:Beginning February 14\, Oak welcomes Scott Kellogg as our resi
 dent tarot reader. With over twenty years of experience as a tarot practit
 ioner\, teacher\, and community builder\, Scott offers readings that are i
 ntuitive\, thoughtful\, and deeply attuned to the person across the table.
 \nHis work gently explores your inner landscape\, your emotions\, desires
 \, and the unseen patterns shaping your life. These sessions are less abou
 t prediction and more about remembrance\, helping you reconnect with your 
 inner knowing and the quiet wisdom you already carry.\nScott holds space w
 ith care\, curiosity\, and respect\, creating a grounded and welcoming exp
 erience for women and femme centered seekers at every stage of life. A rea
 ding with Scott invites clarity\, reassurance\, and a sense of being truly
  seen.
