BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Hope for the Holidays
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261117T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261119T070000
UID:7425a2604427ac6ba08865b5889b0843@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Our annual Hope for the Holidays tree festival has dozens of u
 nique and festive holiday trees decorated by local businesses\, organizati
