BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Garlands & Greenery Open House at Wylie House Museum
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261205T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261205T160000
UID:5d6f8b0ed1e153f3217116fcc0455b8b@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Wylie House Museum for its festive Garlands & Greenery Op
 en House on Saturday\, December 5\, from 10 a.m. to 4 p.m. This free\, dro
 p-in event invites you to experience the museum adorned for the holiday se
 ason.\nWander through the historic house at your own pace\, surrounded by 
 fresh greenery and traditional holiday decorations. Costumed staff will be
  on hand to welcome you\, share stories\, and answer questions.\nEnjoy liv
 e music throughout the day\, featuring the Dickens Carolers\, IU student m
 usicians and á cappella groups\, and the Horseshoe Bend String Band. In t
 he Museum’s Education Center\, warm up with hot cider and cocoa\, enjoy 
 holiday cookies\, and try your hand at family-friendly craft activities.\n
 Come celebrate the season with music\, merriment\, and the timeless beauty
  of Wylie House Museum! No registration required.\nParking: Designated\, f
 ree Wylie House parking spots are located behind the museum and education 
 center\, accessible via the alley. Free street parking is located directly
  in front of the museum on 2nd St. and is permissible on Saturdays in all 
 the area neighborhood residential zoned spaces.\nAccessibility: The museum
  has accessible parking next to the museum’s Morton C. Bradley\, Jr. Edu
 cation Center\, with a path that leads to a ramp at the back door entrance
  of the museum. While the historic home’s second floor is only accessibl
 e by staircase\, digital images and virtual tour options are provided for 
 visitors who cannot visit the second floor. Please contact us in advance o
 f your visit to discuss any specific needs.\nLooking for a fully guided to
 ur of the historic home? Visit Wylie House Museum on Friday\, December 4\;
  Friday\, December 11\; or Saturday\, December 12. Free holiday season tou
 rs are offered at the top of each hour from 10 a.m. to 4 p.m.\, with the f
 inal tour beginning at 3 p.m.
GEO:39.1617006;-86.5309065
LOCATION:Wylie House\, 307 E. 2nd Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47401
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/garlands-greenery-open-house-at
 -wylie-house-museum/60235/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
X-SOURCE-URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/events/
END:VEVENT
