BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:A Cure for Wellness | Staff Selects
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261212T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261212T213000
UID:0f326b948cd4f43f0ab29290d45ed9b6@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Gore Verbinski’s visually stunning psychological horror film
  A Cure for Wellness follows an ambitious financial executive\, Lockhart\,
  as he is tasked to visit an unsettling wellness center in the Swiss Alps 
 in search of his company’s CEO. Lockhart soon discovers the disturbing n
 ature of the center and those who are seemingly trapped inside with no wis
 h to venture outside the center's walls. Actors Mia Goth\, Dane DeHaan\, a
 nd Jason Isaacs deliver a chilling depiction of the consuming nature of mo
 netary obsession\, modern capitalism\, and the overpowering drive to power
  and success that is commonly sought by modern society. [146 min\; horror
 \; English]
GEO:39.168585;-86.517361
LOCATION:IU Cinema\, 1213 E. 7th Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47405
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/a-cure-for-wellness-staff-selec
 ts/60202/
