 her favorite books\, a lonely woman hobbles and holds her favorite novelis
 t hostage\, giving him no choice but to write a new book\, exactly the way
  she wants it—and she's not going to let him go until it's complete. For
  his original novella\, King based the character of the unstable fan\, Ann
 ie\, on Mark David Chapman\, who at some point before murdering John Lenno
 n met King and asked for an autograph\, introducing himself as King's "num
 ber one fan." Misery features a stellar supporting cast\, including Hollyw
 ood legends Richard Farnsworth and Lauren Bacall. Kathy Bates received a B
 est Actress Oscar win for her role as the lonely and depraved Annie. [107 
