 ing throughout the holidays with brand-new guests each night\, this festiv
 e evening brings together local luminaries\, performers\, and personalitie
 s. Each episode features interviews\, games\, live music\, comedy\, surpri
 se talents\, and a few unexpected twists. Complete with cameras and live m
 onitors\, audiences won’t just watch the show—they’ll feel like they
 ’re part of the broadcast. It’s joyful\, it’s unpredictable\, and it
 ’s the most Constellation way imaginable to celebrate the season.\nSee C
