DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261218T203000
UID:14284fc6b97632ca66986f70ef2db412@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:A little sparkle\, a little creativity\, and something beautif
 ul to wear.\nJoin Jen for a hands-on jewelry-making workshop where you'll 
 learn the art of wire wrapping while creating your very own wire-wrapped b
 eaded bracelet.\nWorking with beautiful beads and wire\, you'll explore si
 mple wire-wrapping techniques to create a bracelet that's entirely your ow
 n. Choose your colors\, play with textures\, and bring together a combinat
 ion of beads that feels like you.\nWhether you're drawn to earthy stones\,
  subtle shimmer\, or a little extra sparkle\, you'll leave with a one-of-a
 -kind piece of jewelry made by your own hands.\nNo previous jewelry-making
  experience is needed. Just bring yourself and your creativity. All materi
 als are provided.\nCome spend a cozy December evening making something bea
 utiful\, learning a new skill\, and enjoying a little creative time for yo
 urself.\nAll workshops are non-refundable.
GEO:39.1671921;-86.5334276
LOCATION:Gather Shoppe\, 116 N. Walnut Street\, Bloomington\, IN 47404
URL:https://www.visitbloomington.com/event/wire-wrapped-wonders-beaded-bra
 celets/60172/
X-SOURCE:Visit Bloomington
