SUMMARY:An Enemy of the People
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270204
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270222
UID:4790c47329e77c40d36f9b638187f9ee@visitbloomington.com
DESCRIPTION:Constellation Stage & Screen presents “An Enemy of the Peopl
 e” on stage February 4 - 21 at the Waldron Auditorium.\nThis Tony-nomina
 ted adaptation of Henrik Ibsen’s masterpiece follows a small-town doctor
  who discovers a catastrophe that risks the lives of everyone in town. Aft
 er raising the alarm\, he is shaken to his core as those in power\, includ
 ing his own brother\, not only try to silence him—they try to destroy hi
 m.\nSee Constellation’s website for more information\, including a detai
 led performance schedule. Learn more and find tickets at https://seeconste
 llation.org/mainstage/enemy-of-the-people/
GEO:39.1657967;-86.5339376
LOCATION:122 S Walnut St\, Bloomington\, IN 47404
